---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteForms } from '../config/site';
const { review, contact, newsletter } = siteForms();
const ownedRelay = !review && contact === 'https://limitlesslp.com/contact-approaching-infinity.php';
const ownedNewsletter = !review && newsletter === 'https://limitlesslp.com/contact-approaching-infinity.php';
---
<Layout title="Privacy — Approaching Infinity" description="How Approaching Infinity handles contact inquiries and voluntary newsletter signup."><section class="page-shell"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-heading"><h1>Keep your details private.</h1><p>Contact and newsletter signup are separate choices.</p></div><div class="prose">
  <h2>Contact</h2><p>Use only the details needed to explain your inquiry. Do not send account numbers, financial records, benefit records, passwords or attachments. Inquiries are intended for Justin Roopnarine and Maria Sison so the team can review and reply.</p><p>{contact ? 'The form collects your name, reply email, topic, message and any optional organization or website you provide.' : 'The online contact form is not open. If you email the team, your email service and ours process that correspondence.'} Contacting us does not subscribe you to any newsletter.</p>
  <h2>Newsletter</h2><p>{ownedNewsletter ? 'Signup asks for your email and a separate, unchecked consent box. It sends a pending signup request through our Hostinger-hosted relay to service@limitlesslp.com, with Maria copied. The email records your address, the consent wording and version, signup page and a request time reported by your browser. That time is not independently verified. Our team must reply to confirm you control the email address before adding you to a manually managed sending roster.' : newsletter ? 'Signup asks for your email and voluntary consent. Follow the provider’s confirmation instructions; submitting the form alone does not confirm a subscription.' : 'Newsletter collection is not open yet.'} Newsletter signup remains separate from guest, sponsor and event participation.</p>
  {ownedNewsletter && <p>The relay creates no subscriber database. Requests and confirmation replies are retained in the shared Google Workspace inbox to manage consent. To withdraw a request, unsubscribe or ask for deletion, reply to the team or email <a href="mailto:service@limitlesslp.com">service@limitlesslp.com</a>. We use an opt-out record to prevent further newsletter sends; that record may retain the email address and opt-out date for that purpose. A signup request does not authorize a campaign; the team must check confirmations and opt-outs before sending.</p>}
  {ownedRelay && <><h2>How the contact form works</h2><p>The form sends your inquiry to our contact relay on limitlesslp.com, hosted by Hostinger. The relay validates the fields and sends an email to service@limitlesslp.com with a copy to Maria Sison. It does not create a form-submission database or add you to a mailing list.</p><p>Our hosting and email services process the request and correspondence. Email copies may remain with the team for handling and following up on your inquiry. To request deletion of correspondence held by the team, use the contact details below. See the <a href="https://www.hostinger.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hostinger privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google privacy policy</a>.</p></>}
  <h2>Your financial worksheet</h2><p>Use a blank copy privately on your own device or on paper. We do not ask you to upload or send a completed financial worksheet.</p>
  {review && <><h2>Local review only</h2><p>Demo forms send fictional test values to a server on this computer only. The handler validates them in memory, does not log request bodies, saves no submissions and sends no email. Closing the demo server ends the test. This is not a live collection service.</p></>}
  <h2>Questions and deletion requests</h2><p>To ask about correspondence you sent or request deletion, <a href="mailto:service@limitlesslp.com,msison@limitlesslp.com">email the team</a>. Please identify the inquiry without adding sensitive records.</p>
  {(!contact && !newsletter) && <p>Before opening online collection, we will identify the service provider, explain its processing, and publish the applicable retention and unsubscribe details here.</p>}
</div></div></section></Layout>
